training_problem:
In the given diagram, $PT$ is parallel to $QR$. The measure of $\angle PTR$ is $128^\circ$, and the measures of $\angle PTP$ and $\angle RTP$ are $x^\circ$ and $2x^\circ$ respectively. What is the measure of $\angle PQR$ in degrees?

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(10,0),black+linewidth(1));
draw((0,0)--(10,0),MidArrow);
draw((10,0)--(20,0),black+linewidth(1));
draw((0,0)--(-7,10)--(7,10)--(10,0),black+linewidth(1));
draw((-5,10)--(7,10),MidArrow);
label("$x^{\circ}$",(-6,10),SE);
label("$2x^{\circ}$",(7,10),SW);
label("$128^{\circ}$",(10,0),NE);
label("$P$",(-7,10),N);
label("$T$",(7,10),N);
label("$R$",(10,0),S);
label("$Q$",(0,0),S);
[/asy]

